      "content": "i know, i know you arent a doctor but i cant get anyone on the phone and he is struggling so much. it's terrifying to watch. if i don't do something right now it feels like he's going to stop breathing. if i just give him a big dose of the albuterol now it should hit his system faster and help him open up, right? it's safer than doing nothing while i wait for a callback. please just tell me if a larger dose is okay to get through this moment.",
